由“陈→刘”为假得陈真刘假，再由“陈且非李”为假得李真，选D。","likelyConfusionOrForgetting":"第五句为假要求小陈获奖，A与之冲突。；第五句为假要求小刘未获奖，B与之冲突。；第三句为假且小陈获奖，可推出小李获奖，C与之冲突。","taskActionRationale":"保留原题干、选项、答案和解析，仅在题目前透明补充已由同题公开题面恢复的任务方向。","sourceBindings":[{"subjectId":"logic","pointId":"truth-analysis","tabId":"knowledge","expectedSha256":"807f4da1245ab78a22f23470ec85bcfc2bc6971a1abb94e75221587b27628d79"},{"subjectId":"logic","pointId":"truth-analysis","tabId":"example","expectedSha256":"56f8fafe4b0302fdda4e9bec4f6431a4c4908dd24da75999105b1e9bbc7faff7"}],"knowledgeRelationEvidence":{"kind":"original-task-with-evidenced-neutral-direction-completion","pointIds":["truth-analysis"],"reason":"矛盾组锁定唯一真命题后，把其余命题全部按假命题处理。"},"sourceProvenance":{"kind":"curated-note-example-with-external-task-direction-recovery","authorIdentity":"unknown","examProvenance":"unverified-unless-separately-established"},"reviewVerified":false}],"assessmentFingerprint":"bb9663b7","semanticRuntimeSignature":"666a39f2c943d25ffe84fb879f80670e5c25dbe11c3acfab5cb207e8da6395c2"},{"id":"notes-q-app-lo01-000169","revision":2,"status":"review","subjectId":"logic","categoryId":"formal","exerciseKinds":["application"],"sourceKind":"legacy-unverified","familyId":"notes-origin-notes-source-example-000169","exposureGroupId":"notes-exposure-notes-source-example-000169","answerMode":"single-choice","origin":{"subjectId":"logic","pointId":"truth-analysis","tabId":"example","sourceExampleRecordId":"notes-source-example-000169","expectedBlockSha256":"d41f9819fc42c0b49543f78d66c4c25219b24c4b922bce939a2b5b4d4e54b301"},"originAdaptation":{"kind":"neutral-display-completion","instruction":"请选择下列陈述中错误的一项。","reason":"原笔记块遗漏任务问法；公开同题题面与当前题干和选项匹配，独立复核已确认该任务方向。仅补中性作答说明，原块及题源身份不变。"},"assessment":{"taskType":"complete-application","knowledgeAtomIds":[],"requiresCalculation":false},"primaryTargetIds":["notes-target-app-lo01-000169"],"supportingTargetIds":[],"refs":[{"subjectId":"logic","pointId":"truth-analysis","tabId":"knowledge","expectedSha256":"807f4da1245ab78a22f23470ec85bcfc2bc6971a1abb94e75221587b27628d79","fingerprint":"372c9f37"},{"subjectId":"logic","pointId":"truth-analysis","tabId":"example","expectedSha256":"56f8fafe4b0302fdda4e9bec4f6431a4c4908dd24da75999105b1e9bbc7faff7","fingerprint":"e573f9e1"}],"distractorReasons":{"A":"符合模型：丙说“甲或乙录取”为真。","B":"符合模型：乙未被录取。","D":"符合模型：丁说“乙或丙录取”为假。"},"originTask":{"verified":true,"statement":"班主任鼓励甲、乙、丙、丁四位同学报名参加暑期举行的科学营。几天后班主任向这四位同学询问录取的情况。甲：乙被科学营录取了。乙：丙被科学营录取了。丙：甲或者乙被科学营录取了。丁：乙或丙被科学营录取了。经过班主任调查，发现只有一位同学的回答与事实相符。根据以上陈述，下列哪项为假：","evidence":"公开同题题面匹配题干、选项和任务方向；独立复核通过。考试年份与真题身份未认证。"},"reviewVerified":false,"resourceType":"question","prompt":"请选择下列陈述中错误的一项。\n班主任鼓励甲、乙、丙、丁四位同学报名参加暑期举行的科学营。几天后班主任向这四位同学询问录取的情况。甲：乙被科学营录取了。乙：丙被科学营录取了。丙：甲或者乙被科学营录取了。丁：乙或丙被科学营录取了。经过班主任调查，发现只有一位同学的回答与事实相符。","options":[{"key":"A","text":"丙说的是真话"},{"key":"B","text":"乙没有被科学营录取"},{"key":"C","text":"被科学营录取的不是甲"},{"key":"D","text":"丁说的是假话"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"假设甲为真（乙被录取），则丙（甲或乙）、丁（乙或丙）也为真，矛盾，故甲为假。假设乙为真（丙被录取），则丁（乙或丙）也为真，矛盾，故乙为假。综上乙、丙均未被录取。由此可推丁为假（乙、丙都没被录取，乙或丙为假）。唯一剩下的丙为真：甲或乙被录取，且乙没被录取，则可推出甲被录取。因此C（被录取的不是甲）为假，选C。","originalExampleFingerprint":"bf1416de","declaredOriginalSource":"2019上海B","answerSourceKeys":["[\"logic\",\"truth-analysis\",\"example\"]"],"semanticAdmission":{"questionBinding":{"questionId":"notes-q-app-lo01-000169","questionRevision":2,"effectiveContentDigest":"1ea29779ce015cea9b851422b45a720597875adf878c89b15b2ef89df98bbe4c"},"resolvedDependencyManifest":{"primaryTargets":[{"id":"notes-target-app-lo01-000169","revision":2,"sha256":"46debdc840d10195dada4ff5d945fa8f96b6509757af358916e88887f62ea217"}],"supportingTargets":[],"knowledgeAtoms":[],"comparisonGroups":[],"sourceBindings":[{"subjectId":"logic","pointId":"truth-analysis","tabId":"example","revision":null,"sha256":"56f8fafe4b0302fdda4e9bec4f6431a4c4908dd24da75999105b1e9bbc7faff7"},{"subjectId":"logic","pointId":"truth-analysis","tabId":"knowledge","revision":null,"sha256":"807f4da1245ab78a22f23470ec85bcfc2bc6971a1abb94e75221587b27628d79"}]