是：","evidence":"公开同题题面匹配任务方向；解析纠错经独立逻辑证明。考试年份与真题身份未认证。"},"reviewVerified":false,"resourceType":"question","prompt":"请选择符合工作人员说法的花种。\n甲、乙、丙三人对一块花田里种植的花朵品种做了两次猜测。甲：①它是月季；②它不是玫瑰。乙：①它不是月季；②它是玫瑰。丙：①它不是月季；②它不是牡丹。工作人员听后表示：你们三人中，只有一个人两次都猜对了，一个人猜对了一次，还有一个人完全猜错了。","options":[{"key":"A","text":"玫瑰"},{"key":"B","text":"月季"},{"key":"C","text":"牡丹"},{"key":"D","text":"玫瑰、月季和牡丹之外的花种"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"代入各选项并统计甲、乙、丙猜对的次数：A玫瑰对应0、2、2，不符合；B月季对应2、0、1，恰好一人全对、一人对一次、一人全错；C牡丹对应1、1、1，不符合；D其他花种对应1、1、2，没有人全错。故选B。","originalExampleFingerprint":"e964099b","declaredOriginalSource":"2021广东县级","answerSourceKeys":["[\"logic\",\"truth-analysis\",\"example\"]"],"semanticAdmission":{"questionBinding":{"questionId":"notes-q-app-lo01-000170","questionRevision":1,"effectiveContentDigest":"89fe087ad0eb1db7f24525dcde4f91e9b40480252f848b82f1f443773992132c"},"resolvedDependencyManifest":{"primaryTargets":[{"id":"notes-target-app-lo01-000170","revision":1,"sha256":"6f3e0fb062f024c8fdccbd53a2425c3419965d9c1cd41bac0099cdd6b36169ed"}],"supportingTargets":[],"knowledgeAtoms":[],"comparisonGroups":[],"sourceBindings":[{"subjectId":"logic","pointId":"truth-analysis","tabId":"example","revision":null,"sha256":"56f8fafe4b0302fdda4e9bec4f6431a4c4908dd24da75999105b1e9bbc7faff7"},{"subjectId":"logic","pointId":"truth-analysis","tabId":"knowledge","revision":null,"sha256":"807f4da1245ab78a22f23470ec85bcfc2bc6971a1abb94e75221587b27628d79"}],"sourceAnchors":[],"originalExample":{"subjectId":"logic","pointId":"truth-analysis","tabId":"example","expectedBlockSha256":"325a70c3cb406ab625878e690bd597f4235a70b40fd5633b4a2c0255c71b05c3","revision":null},"materialGroup":null,"images":[],"sharedSourceBindings":[]},"dependencyDigest":"4a7870614641696c24a72abc72aead06da391289edbe96d12f13b0b12994bab6","ruleVersion":"exam-goal-v4","ruleDigest":"cde4b0cf5c8f1542a5a662cc642037c39b9968aba1618b319d56fd8b62cb8033","receiptId":"app-lo-correct01-independent-notes-q-app-lo01-000170-r1","signatureVersion":"notes-semantic-v1","signat